WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:29.144
"I love field trips," said Eddy.

2
00:00:29.145 --> 00:00:31.451
"The new bridge will be cool.

3
00:00:31.452 --> 00:00:38.252
I can't wait to see it!"

4
00:00:38.253 --> 00:00:42.276
Everyone drove up a hill.

5
00:00:42.277 --> 00:00:53.264
"This hill is steep!" said Poppy.

6
00:00:53.265 --> 00:00:56.969
"I'm tired," said Jeb.

7
00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:59.864
"Me too," said Dipper.

8
00:00:59.865 --> 00:01:09.512
"I'm too tired to play music."

9
00:01:09.513 --> 00:01:13.087
"Up, up, up!" said Ms. Fender.

10
00:01:13.088 --> 00:01:17.013
"We're almost there!"

11
00:01:17.014 --> 00:01:33.273
"Ugh!" said Zippy.

12
00:01:33.274 --> 00:01:35.979
Eddy saw mountains.

13
00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:38.948
He felt the wind.

14
00:01:38.949 --> 00:01:43.932
"Wow!" he said.

15
00:01:43.933 --> 00:01:48.129
"Keep going, everyone!" said Ms. Fender.

16
00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:53.876
"The new bridge is close!"

17
00:01:53.877 --> 00:01:57.544
The road made a sharp turn.

18
00:01:57.545 --> 00:02:02.218
Then Eddy saw something red.

19
00:02:02.219 --> 00:02:05.090
"Whoa!" said Eddy.

20
00:02:05.091 --> 00:02:07.214
"The new bridge!"

21
00:02:07.215 --> 00:02:09.885
Ms. Fender smiled.

22
00:02:09.886 --> 00:02:17.377
"Here we are!" she said.

23
00:02:17.378 --> 00:02:24.546
"Who will go across first?"
